# Dart / Markdown 用 LF。Git 在 Windows 上默认会把 CRLF 写进仓库，
# 造成每次改动都出现「CRLF will be replaced by LF」的噪音警告，
# 也让跨机器的 diff 变得不可读。
*.dart text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf

# 二进制，禁��任何换行转换
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.apk  binary
